  "question": {
    "text": "If the shortest distance between the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>,then value of <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let us change the line into symmetric form.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Put <math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , so we get <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0&#160;</mn></math></p><p>We will get&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> The point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on the line and perpendicular vector will come from&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So the equation of line would be&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />And the other line&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Shortest distance would be&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>When&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>2&#945;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>19</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>19</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
